# Optional settings for Stage 0. Copy to .env at the repository root (ignored by git): compose
# reads it for the api container's defaults, and `make ask` reads the same names from your shell
# for a per-request swap. Everything has a working default; nothing here is required for
# `make start`, `make ingest`, `make build-index`, `make ask`.
#
# Ports bind to 127.0.0.1. If 5432, 8000 or 8333 is taken on your machine:
# CAIRN_PG_PORT=5433
# CAIRN_API_PORT=8001
# CAIRN_S3_PORT=8334

# --- An OpenAI-compatible generator instead of the extractive default --------------------------
# Ollama on the host (Docker Desktop and Linux both resolve host.docker.internal; on Linux
# Ollama must listen on all interfaces: OLLAMA_HOST=0.0.0.0 ollama serve):
# CAIRN_LLM_BASE_URL=http://host.docker.internal:11434/v1
# CAIRN_LLM_MODEL=llama3.2
# CAIRN_LLM_PROVIDER=ollama
#
# A hosted provider:
# CAIRN_LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# CAIRN_LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
# CAIRN_LLM_PROVIDER=openai
# CAIRN_LLM_API_KEY=sk-...
#
# Prices in USD per million tokens, when the model is not in the small built-in table:
# CAIRN_LLM_PRICE_IN_PER_1M=0.15
# CAIRN_LLM_PRICE_OUT_PER_1M=0.60
